that development and decide whether the advantages of

43
00:03:22,940 --> 00:03:25,760
that development are stronger than the disadvantages.

44
00:03:27,060 --> 00:03:29,860
From there, we can figure out if it's

45
00:03:29,860 --> 00:03:32,120
