00:12:18,270 --> 00:12:29,230
The correct answers are B and E.

161
00:12:29,790 --> 00:12:35,870
So considering these two aspects, this essay has a good structure and length.

162
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:44,820
A. Introduction For the advantages and disadvantages essays, to

163
00:12:44,820 --> 00:12:52,320
write an introduction that achieves a band 6 .0 plus for task response, we need to do two things.

164
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:58,560
General statement introduced by paraphrasing that 

165
00:12:58,760 --> 00:13:02,460
The subject topic, phenomenon mentioned in the question has both

166
