the advantages and disadvantages.

167
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:06,720
Thesis statement.

168
00:13:07,300 --> 00:13:10,100
State the writer's opinion on whether the advantages

169
00:13:10,100 --> 00:13:15,520
of this subject, topic or phenomenon  are stronger than the disadvantages.

