179
00:14:50,780 --> 00:14:56,220
We can see that this is a well -written introduction, so there's nothing to improve yet.

180
00:14:56,640 --> 00:14:57,960
You can learn from it.

181
00:14:58,340 --> 00:15:00,940
For the body, to ensure we achieve band 6

182
00:15:00,940 --> 00:15:04,500
for task response, we follow two steps.

183
00:15:05,260 --> 00:15:05,920
Step 1.

184
00:15:06,660 --> 00:15:11,000
Identify which side is more supported and put it in body 2.

185
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:17,820
Our thesis supports advantages, so we must move the advantages paragraph to the end.

186
00:15:18,420 --> 00:15:19,300
