203
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:14,940
Saving money and time, as workers don't have to commute.

204
00:16:15,740 --> 00:16:19,860
Similar to the previous paragraph, body 1, disadvantages,

205
00:16:20,640 --> 00:16:23,480
