213
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,440
Poor work-life balance.

214
00:16:47,060 --> 00:16:51,300
This happens when workers overwork because they lack clear boundaries.

215
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:56,800
Put them all together and here is the complete improved outline for our essay.

216
00:16:56,800 --> 00:17:04,190
Those are two steps to achieve band 6.0+ for TR in the body. 

217
00:17:04,390 --> 00:17:13,020
Step 1: Identify which side is more supported: Advantage or Disadvantage, then write it in body 2. 

